# No secrets in chat

Agents must **never** ask the human to paste a secret into the chat, and must
**never** echo a secret value in transcripts, logs, or commits.

## Why

Chat and tool traces leak. One paste becomes durable debt.

## Check

Before any login, token, or key step: use a desktop capture dialog, env file
outside git, or vault CLI — not Composer freeform. Confirm only `ok` / username /
length, never the value.
